      "side": 1,
      "message": "CFX_Matrix::GetInverse() currently just returns the identity matrix if there isn\u0027t an inverse: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/_/pdfium/pdfium/+/ab124d69bdf3683f830decc7d10b8dd98643fae9:core/fxcrt/fx_coordinates.cpp;l\u003d381-385;drc\u003dc440145ffc24384f7260c7c8315fbabcf7163746;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0\n\nIf that\u0027s just an implementation detail, then I can just construct the identity matrix explicitly here if not invertible.",
